<div class="page-header">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>About Bizbox</h1>
</div>

<div style="max-width: 700px;">
    <p>Starting a small business usually means sourcing equipment from several vendors with no single reference point for quality or price. Bizbox brings a curated equipment catalog for four business types into one place, plus a resale marketplace so equipment doesn't go to waste when an owner upgrades.</p>

    <p>Browse Coffee Shop, Bakery, Restaurant, or Salon equipment, buy new listings or resale from other users side by side, and pay with eSewa or Khalti at checkout.</p>
</div>
